@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #F6FBF8
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
actor "顾客端" as Client
participant "API网关" as Gateway
participant "预约服务" as Reserve
participant "会员服务" as MemberSvc
participant "支付平台" as Pay
participant "通知服务" as Msg
participant "监控/日志" as Obs
Client -> Gateway: 提交预约请求(traceId)
Gateway -> Obs: 记录入口日志
Gateway -> Reserve: 鉴权后转发预约参数
Reserve -> MemberSvc: 查询会员等级/优惠/授权
MemberSvc --> Reserve: 返回权益与限制
Reserve -> Reserve: 校验时段、人数、猫咪状态
alt 锁桌成功
  Reserve -> Reserve: 写入桌位锁和预约草稿
  Reserve -> Pay: 创建订金支付
  Pay --> Reserve: 支付回调(成功/失败)
  Reserve -> Obs: 记录支付回调与状态变更
  Reserve -> Msg: 发送确认/提醒消息
  alt 通知失败
    Msg -> Msg: 进入补偿队列并重试
    Msg -> Obs: 记录失败原因
  end
  Msg --> Client: 推送预约结果
else 锁桌失败
  Reserve --> Client: 返回候补或重新选择提示
  Reserve -> Obs: 记录库存冲突
end
@enduml
